ion": {"id": 1, "region": "europe"}}, {"id": 248015, "date": 1506556800, "platform": 3, "y": 2017, "release_region": {"id": 2, "region": "north_america"}}, {"id": 161218, "date": 1542672000, "platform": 14, "y": 2018, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 42987, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/r9bnc1hfyrgbxgbftqfr.jpg"}, {"id": 210912, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/puiwrapnxdvjjiy2gkcp.jpg"}, {"id": 42988, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/bfpn6dfw1ow8i3wpexk3.jpg"}, {"id": 42990, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/zrqwkot4jpga5xbi2nwb.jpg"}, {"id": 210916, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/g6sodjhe9hvrgdm8s032.jpg"}, {"id": 42991, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/e9hhqm5nvxyxppbrhi9s.jpg"}, {"id": 42989, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/bqnlb13q0ah2l7ioslqf.jpg"}, {"id": 210915, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/tkwtagw7psi7zkv1wtmv.jpg"}, {"id": 210914, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/cwbj3sz9z80xnh7pdkrx.jpg"}, {"id": 210918, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ees6gx4wycxfmfganjvo.jpg"}, {"id": 210913, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/fut6nxqcwezlnxykfepm.jpg"}, {"id": 210917, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/itebycobrpgfw2ypk1qe.jpg"}], "slug": "total-war-warhammer-ii", "storyline": "\"Millennia ago, besieged by a Chaos invasion, a conclave of High Elf mages forged a vast, arcane vortex. Its purpose was to draw the Winds of Magic from the world as a sinkhole drains an ocean, and blast the Daemonic hordes back to the Realm of Chaos. Now the Great Vortex falters, and the world again stands at the brink of ruin.\n\nPowerful forces move to heal the maelstrom and avert catastrophe. Yet others seek to harness its terrible energies for their own bitter purpose. The race is on, and the very fate of the world will lie in the hands of the victor.\n\nPrince Tyrion, Defender of Ulthuan, guides the High Elves in their desperate efforts to stabilise the vortex as it roils above their home continent.\n\nAtop his palanquin-throne, the Slann Mage-Priest Mazdamundi directs his Lizardmen war-hosts as they surge northward from Lustria. He, too, is intent on preventing cataclysm, though the methods of The Old Ones must prevail.\n\nThe Witch King Malekith and his sadistic Dark Elf hordes spew forth from Naggaroth and their labyrinthine Black Arks. He tastes great weakness in the vortex \u2013 and great opportunity in its demise.\n\nMeanwhile a fourth, secretive race stirs, their motives obscured by sinister plots and machinations. The time for revelation is nigh\u2026\n\nFour races, four outcomes, a single goal: control of the Great Vortex, for good or ill.\"", "summary": "Total War: Warhammer II is a strategy game of titanic proportions. Choose from four unique, varied factions and wage war your way; mounting a campaign of conquest to save or destroy a vast and vivid fantasy world. This is a game of two halves: one a turn-based open-world campaign, and the other intense, tactical real-time battles across the fantastical landscapes of the New World.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/total-war-warhammer-ii", "videos": [{"id": 15022, "name": "First Look: Campaign Trailer", "video_id": "x_if9xNHw-Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x_if9xNHw-Y", "title": "Total War: Warhammer II - First Look: Campaign Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/x_if9xNHw-Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 16182, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "n2wvG5HBwx4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n2wvG5HBwx4", "title": "Total War: Warhammer II - Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/n2wvG5HBwx4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 14520, "name": "Interview", "video_id": "W9nHYGR8F2o", "url": "https://www.you